---
import { fxRates } from '../../data/content';
---
<section id="ruta" class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-ink"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-2">
<p class="kick text-amber-400">Ruta marítima principal</p>
<h2 class="h mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white">Shanghai / Ningbo → Manzanillo</h2>
<p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">Conectamos Asia con México con servicios seguros y tiempos competitivos. Tránsito marítimo promedio de 30–45 días, puerto a puerto.</p>
<a href="#navieras" class="btn ghost mt-6">Ver ruta completa →</a>
<div class="mono mt-8 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-xs"><p class="text-slate-400 mb-2 tracking-widest">FX · INDICATIVO</p>
<div class="space-y-2">{fxRates.map(f => <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-white">{f.pair}</span><span class="text-slate-300">{f.rate}</span><span class={f.up ? 'text-emerald-400' : 'text-red-400'}>{f.change}</span></div>)}</div></div></div>
<div class="lg:col-span-3"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-deep border border-white/10 p-3"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 260" class="w-full" role="img" aria-label="Ruta marítima de Ningbo a Manzanillo por el Pacífico">
<g stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".05"><path d="M0 65H400M0 130H400M0 195H400M100 0V260M200 0V260M300 0V260"/></g>
<path d="M0 40 L40 28 L78 52 L92 96 L70 128 L84 160 L58 196 L30 190 L0 210Z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".07"/>
<path d="M400 30 L352 36 L318 74 L330 120 L312 150 L338 172 L322 196 L352 214 L400 230Z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".07"/>
<path id="r" class="dash" d="M92 100 C 150 40, 250 40, 322 165" fill="none" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<circle r="5" fill="#fff"><animateMotion dur="7s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#r"/></animateMotion></circle>
<circle cx="92" cy="100" r="7" fill="#F59E0B"/><circle cx="322" cy="165" r="7" fill="#F59E0B"/>
<text x="92" y="124" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">Ningbo · Shanghai</text>
<text x="322" y="190" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">Manzanillo</text>
<text x="205" y="150" fill="#64748b" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="3">OCÉANO PACÍFICO</text>
<text x="200" y="245" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">Tránsito marítimo promedio: 30–45 días</text></svg></div></div>
</div></section>
